  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You excel at causing havoc with computers and electronics. As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>, you can lock down a computer terminal by making a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_Computer\" title=\"Use Computer\">Use Computer</a> check, making it potentially difficult for anyone else to access. That computer is considered <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unfriendly\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unfriendly\">Unfriendly</a> to anyone other than you who attempts to use it, and the result of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_Computer\" title=\"Use Computer\">Use Computer</a> check replaces the computer's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a> on an attempt to change its <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attitude\">Attitude</a>.<br><br>This effect ends if anyone else succeeds in adjusting the computer's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attitude\">Attitude</a> to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Indifferent\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Indifferent\">Indifferent</a>. You cannot <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Take_20\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Take 20\">Take 20</a> on this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_Computer\" title=\"Use Computer\">Use Computer</a> check.",
